  "description": "Crew Dart20\nThe Crew Dart V3 20\" brings all the upgrades of the 24\" model into a tighter, more compact build. Same bike life energy. Just built for riders who want more control without giving up performance. Class 2 compliant for a safe and legal ride. With a top speed of 20mph and a range up to 20 miles using throttle, and 25–35 miles with pedal assist, the Dart 20 delivers the power and versatility you need to ride farther, cruise longer, and stay in control.\nThe compact 20\" setup offers a lower standover and a more agile, easy-to-handle feel, making it perfect for tighter spots and technical riding. An upgraded chromoly steel frame with refined geometry delivers a stable, responsive ride, while the new bench-style saddle improves comfort and balance with a clean, locked-in feel for longer sessions.\nA 750w rear hub motor paired with a 48v / 10Ah battery delivers smooth, punchy power, backed by hydraulic disc brakes for confident stopping control. Fat 20\" x 4.0\" Crew Takeover Tires add grip, shock absorption, and street-ready style—making the Dart V3 20\" a powerful, approachable choice for everyday rides and full ride-outs. Recommended for riders 4'10\"-5'10\".",
